    <!-- Rules -->
    <string name="rules_title">Detective\'s rules</string>
    <string name="rules_body">Sleuth never talks. It does not ask questions, it does not offer help, it does not chat, and it never speaks aloud. Everything you type is treated as a place to go or a thing to look up — never as a conversation.\n\nThe browser records silently while a case is armed: pages visited, screenshots taken, notes written. Nothing is uploaded, nothing is shared, and the record stays on this device until you export it or wipe it.</string>

